# Relationship gossip (RELATIONSHIPS.md section 6.2): eleven ties the bibles left unwritten, each askable in both directions once the player is a friend of the speaker and has met the other villager. Same shape as gossip_topics.fscript. Compiled to zz_fs_relationship_gossip.json.

# ---- Felix and Wren (2 / 2): the catch and the stories ----

topic felix.gossip.wren
  npc felix
  label Ask about Wren
  plays felix.gossip.wren.d
  if hearts:felix>=3 && flag:met.wren
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue felix.gossip.wren.d
n0 felix: Wren buys my best fish and listens to the rest. Nobody listens like she does.
  next n1
n1 felix: Don't tell her the tuna grows on purpose.

topic wren.gossip.felix
  npc wren
  label Ask about Felix
  plays wren.gossip.felix.d
  if hearts:wren>=3 && flag:met.felix
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue wren.gossip.felix.d
n0 wren: Felix is my favorite regular, my darling. He has never once asked me to keep it short.
  next n1
n1 wren: Between us, I tell his tuna story louder than he does.

# ---- Felix and Ione (1 / 2): the sea book set aside each winter ----

topic felix.gossip.ione
  npc felix
  label Ask about Ione
  plays felix.gossip.ione.d
  if hearts:felix>=3 && flag:met.ione
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue felix.gossip.ione.d
n0 felix: Ione sets a sea book aside for me each winter. I say I don't read.
  next n1
n1 felix: The lighthouse one. Twice.

topic ione.gossip.felix
  npc ione
  label Ask about Felix
  plays ione.gossip.felix.d
  if hearts:ione>=3 && flag:met.felix
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue ione.gossip.felix.d
n0 ione: I set a sea book aside for Felix each winter. He says he doesn't read.
  next n1
n1 ione: He returns them early, with a fish scale for a bookmark.

