  cooldown 6

dialogue juno.gossip.ione.d
n0 juno: Okay, okay, okay: Ione has a book with every maker's mark in the county! Hundreds! None of them are mine. Yet.

# ---- Marcus and Wren (1 / rivalry): the bet on the hall roof ----

topic marcus.gossip.wren
  npc marcus
  label Ask about Wren
  plays marcus.gossip.wren.d
  if hearts:marcus>=3 && flag:met.wren
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue marcus.gossip.wren.d
n0 marcus: Wren runs a pool on the hall roof. Nobody will tell me the odds.
  next n1
n1 marcus: I suspect they are poor.

topic wren.gossip.marcus
  npc wren
  label Ask about Marcus
  plays wren.gossip.marcus.d
  if hearts:wren>=3 && flag:met.marcus
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue wren.gossip.marcus.d
n0 wren: Marcus says the roof is nearly fixed, my darling. I've had money on "nearly" for years.
  next n1
n1 wren: I am very close to being rich.

