# ---- Dr. Penn and Bram (1 / 1): the burn he calls weather ----

topic odalys.gossip.bram
  npc odalys
  label Ask about Bram
  plays odalys.gossip.bram.d
  if hearts:odalys>=3 && flag:met.bram
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue odalys.gossip.bram.d
n0 odalys: Bram refuses to call a burn a burn. He calls it weather.
  next n1
n1 odalys: In return he repaired my instrument case, unasked. I have stopped objecting.

topic bram.gossip.odalys
