  plays bram.gossip.odalys.d
  if hearts:bram>=3 && flag:met.odalys
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue bram.gossip.odalys.d
n0 bram: Hm. Doctor wants my hands rested. Hands disagree.
  next n1
n1 bram: Fixed her instrument case. She stopped asking.

