dialogue piper.gossip.ione.d
n0 piper: Ione sets songbooks aside for me, and I never bring them back! She calls it a long loan!
  next n1
n1 piper: I call it a chorus of overdue.

topic ione.gossip.piper
  npc ione
  label Ask about Piper
  plays ione.gossip.piper.d
  if hearts:ione>=3 && flag:met.piper
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue ione.gossip.piper.d
n0 ione: Piper keeps the songbooks for months. She returns them as verses, written in the margins.
  next n1
n1 ione: Hazel corrects the scansion. I call it interest.

