topic odalys.gossip.piper
  npc odalys
  label Ask about Piper
  plays odalys.gossip.piper.d
  if hearts:odalys>=3 && flag:met.piper
  priority 1
  cooldown 6

dialogue odalys.gossip.piper.d
n0 odalys: Piper plays in the waiting room by invitation, and I frown. Patients ask for the fiddle by name.
  next n1
n1 odalys: I frown with less conviction each week.
